     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">FYI - resolved this by making sure the input selections to the selectInput dropdown had unique values! Very simple fix but the error message and behavior was confusing. There were repeated draft years of course for multiple players, so you cannot populate a dropdown with multiple repeated values if you&#39;d like to set the default to a specific value on load.</div>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><br><br>On Monday, November 30, 2015 at 11:29:24 PM UTC-5, tcash21 wrote:</div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Hello,<div><br></div><div>I&#39;ve deployed my app here so you can see the behavior: <a href=\"https://tcb-analytics.shinyapps.io/test\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://tcb-analytics.shinyapps.io/test&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792395656723000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3ZTYG17C_7YGCQmbue8T3h\">https://tcb-analytics.shinyapps.io/test</a></div><div><br></div><div>You can see on load the draft year is set to 2011, but then it changes to &quot;&quot; which causes an error in subsetting the data. I thought by simply setting selected = &#39;2011&#39; it would automatically display the data for that year on load. </div><div><br></div><div>Here&#39;s the code for server.R and ui.R.</div><div><br></div><div>server.R</div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">shiny</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\"># Define server logic required to draw a histogram</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>shinyServer</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">function</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> output</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  <br>  </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># Expression that generates a histogram. The expression is</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># wrapped in a call to renderPlot to indicate that:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#800\">#</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#800\">#  1) It is &quot;reactive&quot; and therefore should re-execute automatically</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#800\">#     when inputs change</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#800\">#  2) Its output type is a plot</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  <br>  dataInput </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> reactive</span><span style=\"color:#660\">({</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>    players </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> subset</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">players</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> draft_year </span><span style=\"color:#660\">==</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> input$year</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#008\">return</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">players</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  <br>  output$distPlot </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> renderPlot</span><span style=\"color:#660\">({</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    players </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> dataInput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    weight </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> players$weight </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># NFL Player Weight Data</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    bins </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> seq</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">min</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">weight</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> max</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">weight</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> length</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#008\">out</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> input$bins </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    <br>    </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># draw the histogram with the specified number of bins</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    hist</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">weight</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> breaks </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> bins</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> col </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;darkgray&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> border </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;white&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span></div></code></div><div><br></div></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>ui.R</div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">shiny</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\"># Define UI for application that draws a histogram</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>shinyUI</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">fluidPage</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  <br>  </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># Application title</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  titlePanel</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Hello Shiny!&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  <br>  </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># Sidebar with a slider input for the number of bins</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  sidebarLayout</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    sidebarPanel</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      selectInput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;year&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Draft Year:&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> choices</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">sort</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">players$draft_year</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> selected</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;2011&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      sliderInput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;bins&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                  </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Number of bins:&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                  min </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                  max </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">50</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                  value </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">30</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    <br>    </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># Show a plot of the generated distribution</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    mainPanel</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      plotOutput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;distPlot&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span></div></code></div><div><div><br></div></div></div></blockquote></div>"
    ]
